{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Packs of Panties</strong> is a falling blocks puzzle game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare deliveries by aligning underwear blocks of the same type and connecting them with a box block of the same color to make them disappear! The game ends when no more blocks can be placed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/fa7726e6bfa3218ad094cd9b37986779.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover Marathon mode, a staple of games in this genre. Strategically place your blocks to fill as many boxes as possible and achieve the highest score during a session.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/0fa29688d86da08360bba41309382170.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This mode can be played by up to 3 players, either cooperatively\u2014where everyone contributes to the team score\u2014or competitively, where each player must collect as many panties as possible to stay in the game the longest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/41196f08bcbba73c744a4c2d230f064e.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Objective mode</i> offers limited rounds where you must fill a set number of boxes.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/165730b528b2dcedcfebbbddf1df67bb.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can cooperate with 1 or 2 other players to reach a shared goal, or compete to see who reaches their objective first.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.poster.avif?t=1762521038\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.webm?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026740/extras/31bbebd0d2a98fa214175aa7ca5cd1a7.mp4?t=1762521038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Packs of Panties</strong> is perfect for relaxing or enjoying a friendly moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Delivery in Belgium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026740/e81578b079f982f4b6834b8984daddfe2bd3f420.jpg"},{"name":"Delivery in France","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026740/74454c1a930ae74e8576b2c0bc985e72c0d6989b.jpg"},{"name":"Delivery in China","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026740/2f38873160def6118e18915d382738de7a761fd9.jpg"},{"name":"Delivery in Australia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026740/56cfb5a5f326918f227167e1c72730f93fed6d8b.jpg"},{"name":"Delivery in England","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026740/cf5d6d0caf7b6bf1791954591ded8ba6024b3888.jpg"},{"name":"Delivery in Russia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026740/db410d6dbe2ddc4f1bb45e3032a7af1c6f389479.jpg"},{"name":"Delivery in America","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026740/0c7bf95c818c6126e0f821475d0c4ff28f1ab362.jpg"},{"name":"Delivery in Japan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4026740/e96ba2cd244a53f684eb89a29dacbfa0cf808673.jpg"},{"name":"100 box